# Database — {{ stack.database }}

Migrations live in `db/migrations/` (or your ORM's own dir — keep one source of
truth). See `.claude/rules/data-modes.md` and
`.claude/skills/writing-migrations/`.

- **Demo mode:** no migrations run (data is mocked/in-memory).
- **Full mode:** each schema change ships an ordered, reversible migration here,
  generated from the diff and reviewed before apply.

Never commit secrets or connection strings here — those live in env/secret store.
